# ============================================================================
# Netlify _redirects
# https://docs.netlify.com/routing/redirects/
# ============================================================================

# SPA fallback — hash routing already works without this, but if anyone
# ever visits /shop or /product directly (not via hash) we send them to
# the root so the SPA can pick it up.
/shop       /#shop       200
/product/*  /#product    200
/cart       /#cart       200
/checkout   /#checkout   200
/account    /#account    200
/login      /#login      200
/register   /#register   200

# Robots / sitemap stay as-is
